<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA V SRI LANKA SECOND TEST DRAWN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA V SRI LANKA SECOND TEST DRAWN.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The second and final test between Sri Lanka and India ended in a draw on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 332 and 415-7 declared; India 375 and 281 for 5.</p>
</text>
